  "details": "VRChat Version: 1275\n\nDescription of the bug: Fairly minor bug, but if you open the Quick Menu backwards and then rotate your hand to make it face the correct way, any Quick Menu wings don't have the transparency background. I believe this is only possible in VR.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\nBe in VRChat whilst in VR.\n\nIf needed, open a wing on your Quick Menu, such as the avatar list.\n\nRotate your hand so that if you open the QM, you would just see the backside with the big VRChat logo & backside of the VRCat.\n\nOpen the QM\n\nRotate your hand so the menu is facing you normally\n\nThe wings don’t have their transparent background anymore. However, a simple close and re-open of QM fixes this.\n\nI’ve only tested this on PCVR with Index controllers, but I don’t think the controllers or platform would change anything.\n\nIf I remember the next time I’m in VR, I’ll record and provide a video of this happening. But I feel this should be fairly easy to reproduce.",
